== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: cpuid [ENC: DEFAULT, MAP: 0F, OPC: 0xA2]
     LENGTH:  2
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: MISC
    ISA-SET: I486REAL
    ISA-EXT: BASE
 EXCEPTIONS: NONE
  ANTI-ANAL: ARCHITECTURAL
     AA-EXT: NONE
     AA-LEN: 2
     AA-OPS: 4
  OPTIMIZED: 0F A2 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0   REGISTER      HIDDEN      RW          NONE     32      1      32       INT                          eax
 1   REGISTER      HIDDEN       W          NONE     32      1      32       INT                          ebx
 2   REGISTER      HIDDEN     CRW          NONE     32      1      32       INT                          ecx
 3   REGISTER      HIDDEN       W          NONE     32      1      32       INT                          edx
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: cpuid
   RELATIVE: cpuid

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: cpuid
   RELATIVE: cpuid

== [ SEGMENTS ] ============================================================================================
0F A2 
:..OPCODE
